00:36:15.797 --> 00:36:16.630
RENATA KUMALA: Yeah.

00:36:16.630 --> 00:36:17.040
DIMAS NATAJIWA: Good?

00:36:17.040 --> 00:36:18.035
RENATA KUMALA: Let's go.

00:36:18.035 --> 00:36:18.827
DIMAS NATAJIWA: OK.

00:36:21.537 --> 00:36:22.370
Here is this result.

