OK, from all of
this option, I want

00:36:28.430 --> 00:36:32.080
to see a summary table
that is updated daily.

00:36:32.080 --> 00:36:35.510
So that mean the abbreviation
would be S for summary

00:36:35.510 --> 00:36:36.410
and D for a daily.

00:36:36.410 --> 00:36:37.760
Let's choose the first one.

00:36:37.760 --> 00:36:40.270
DIMAS NATAJIWA: Cool, so
